01:46:06,383 --> 01:46:07,685
[SPEAKER_00]: Unmyeong is Korean.

510
01:46:08,386 --> 01:46:11,550
[SPEAKER_00]: It can be translated as destiny, fate.

511
01:46:12,912 --> 01:46:15,576
[SPEAKER_00]: Why are you here today in this place?

512
01:46:16,477 --> 01:46:31,466
[SPEAKER_00]: It seems like everything is coincidence, but I believe it's based on our so many decisions that we have made in our lives and precious meetings and the moments that we've had in our life.

513
01:46:31,646 --> 01:46:33,127
[SPEAKER_00]: So thank you so much for being here.

514
01:46:33,147 --> 01:46:36,889
[SPEAKER_00]: I think it's our fate to be present in this moment.

515
01:46:37,430 --> 01:46:40,272
[SPEAKER_00]: So this is Unmyeong Destiny.

516
01:46:41,232 --> 01:46:41,832
[SPEAKER_00]: Hope you enjoy.

